\title{limn: A Projection Engine for Distributional Forecasting}
\description{
Predictive distributions, forecasts, proper scoring rules, calibration,
cross-validation and model comparison for models fitted by
\code{\link[illume:ilm_model]{illume::ilm_model()}}. \code{limn} is the third package in a family, after
\code{illumex} for exploration and \code{illume} for inference, and shares their
